],"gloss":"people of the house"},{"surface":"பெருநகை","parts":[{"text":"பெரு","lemma":"பெரு","gloss":"great"},{"text":"நகை","lemma":"நகை","gloss":"laughter"}],"gloss":"great mockery"},{"surface":"காணிய","parts":[{"text":"காண்","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"see"},{"text":"இய","lemma":"இய","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to see"},{"surface":"சிறிதே","parts":[{"text":"சிறிது","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"little"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"a little"}]}],"literal":"Soft shoulders made thin distress, Velan / victorious great Murugan attributes, and mother / as that believes, since, at that juncture / short dark female elephant trunk hidden like / dark-hued boulder possessing mountain lord / quickly may he come, O friend, our / house-people's great mockery to see a little.","translation":"The Velan priest attributes the distress that wasted my soft shoulders to the victorious, great Murugan, and mother believes it to be so. At this juncture, may the lord of the mountains—where dark-hued boulders resemble short, dark female elephants with their trunks tucked in—come quickly, O friend, so that we may see a little of the great mockery of the people of our house.","modern":"மென்மையான தோள்கள் மெலிவடைவதற்குக் காரணமான துன்பத்தை, வேலன் வென்றி தரும் நெடுவேளாகிய முருகனால் வந்தது என்கிறான்; அன்னையும் அதையே உண்மை என்று நம்புகிறாள். இந்தச் சூழ்நிலையில், குட்டையான கரிய பெண் யானை தன் துதிக்கையை மறைத்துக் கொண்டிருப்பதைப் போன்ற கரிய நிறமுடைய பாறைகள் நிறைந்த மலைநாட்டிற்குத் தலைவன் விரைந்து வரட்டும் தோழி! நம் வீட்டில் உள்ளவர்கள் செய்யும் அறியாமையான செயல்களைப் பார்த்து நாம் சிறிது எள்ளி நகையாடுவதற்காக.","explanation":"The companion (tōḻi) speaks to the heroine (talaivi) when the mother, worried about the heroine's physical decline, calls the Velan priest to perform a ritual dance (veriyāṭṭu). The priest foolishly attributes her distress to possession by Lord Murugan, and the mother believes him. The companion suggests that the hero, the lord of the mountain country, should arrive quickly to claim the heroine in marriage. The mountain landscape is described as having dark boulders that look like short female elephants hiding their trunks, which subtly mirrors the secret love that the lovers have been hiding. Once the hero arrives, the family's ritual will be exposed as a mistake, allowing the companion and heroine to laugh at the household's ignorance.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.17],[2.17,2.8],[2.8,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.6],[4.6,5.0],[5.13,5.4],[5.4,5.86],[5.86,6.03],[6.03,6.68],[6.68,7.5],[7.5,7.69],[7.69,8.43],[8.43,8.61],[8.61,9.29],[9.29,10.1],[10.1,10.95],[10.95,11.31],[11.31,11.8],[11.8,12.3],[12.3,12.5],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.6]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,1.9],[1.9,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.8],[3.8,4.3],[4.3,4.94],[5.1,5.7],[5.7,6.3],[6.45,6.6],[6.6,6.75],[6.75,7.65],[7.65,8.4],[8.4,8.63],[8.63,9.54],[9.54,9.77],[9.77,10.49],[10.49,11.3],[11.3,12.2],[12.2,12.5],[12.5,13.2],[13.2,13.7],[13.7,13.9],[13.9,14.3],[14.3,15.0]]},"sync":[[["மென்தோள்","soft shoulders"]],[["நெகிழ்த்த","which made thin"]],[["செல்லல்","distress"]],[["வேலன்","the Velan priest"]],[["வென்றி","victorious"]],[["நெடுவேள்","great Murugan"]],[["என்னும்","attributes to"]],[["அன்னையும்","and mother"]],[["அதுவென","as that"]],[["உணரும்","believes"]],[["ஆயின்","since"]],[["ஆயிடை","at that juncture"]],[["கூழை","short"]],[["இரும்பிடி","dark female elephant"],["கை","trunk"]],[["கை","trunk"],["கரந்தன்ன","resembling having hidden"]],[["கரந்தன்ன","resembling having hidden"]],[["கேழிருந்","dark-hued"]],[["துறுகல்","boulder"]],[["கெழுமலை","mountain-possessing"]],[["நாடன்","lord of the land"]],[["வல்லே","quickly"]],[["வருக","may he come"]],[["தோழி","O friend"],["நம்","our"]],[["இல்லோர்","people of the house"]],[["பெருநகை","great mockery"]],[["காணிய","to see"]],[["சிறிதே","a little"]]]}